<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Hub Power gains 4.28 percent.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Hub Power gains 4.28 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Hub Power Co Ltd jumped 1.30 rupees, or 4.28 percent, to 31.70 on Wednesday on fresh buying, dealers said.</p>
<p>The stock emerged as the volume leader with a turnover of 1,350,000 shares at midday.</p>
<p>&quot;It is a good stock with little risk factor and guaranteed profits,&quot; dealer Hina Akhlaq said. &quot;There has been fresh buying of Hub Power as its price has come down to an attractive level.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
